==Battleground==
*2 [[Red Slug]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Black Slug]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Slug]] spawns after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Slug]] spawns after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s (600%) spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Squire Rel]] (100%) spawns as the boss after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Black Slug]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Slug]] spawns.
**5 [[Black Slug]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Red Slug]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Black Slug]] spawns.
**1 [[Angelic Slug]] spawns.
**1 [[Black Slug]] spawns.
**1 [[Black Slug]] spawns.
**1 [[Red Slug]] spawns.
**1 [[Black Slug]] spawns.
**1 [[Black Slug]] spawns.
**3 [[Angelic Sleipnir]]s spawn, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
To beat this stage, you will need to save up money first by stalling Angel Sluggy. Once you have [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and other strong hitters on the field, prepare for the triple Angelic Sleipnirs. [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] can be a huge help here (even more so if you happen to have his [[True Form]]), but don't use [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], as she won't even be able to get a single hit off. Try to meatshield your ace in the hole as best you can. Don't forget to bring long-range support with you.

